t your combat style. Slap some stickers on. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn new cars and parts by beating <strong>bosses</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No loading screens. No fast travel. <strong>Just use your car.</strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slow down after the fight, go for a ride and <strong>inhale the <i>FUMES</i></strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get lost in the desert. Wander endless, procedural environments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to the <strong>original, guitar-heavy soundtrack</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255190/extras/fumes_wishlist_a.gif?t=1744061483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please <strong>WISHLIST <i>FUMES</i></strong> if you're into this scrap. This way you support the development in the best possible way - it helps more people discover this game that is being made by a small team of 4 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255190/extras/Roadmap.png?t=1744061483\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam the wastes, collect scrap, burn your way through the challenge and rise as the mayhem walker... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...or simply join our <strong>Discord </strong> server to hang out with us and other travelers like you. Get involved in the creation of this twisted world!</p>","developers":["FUMES team"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1920430","name":"FUMES"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255190/he